{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1369542-contrasting-worldviews-and-views-on-sexuality-in-princess-and-beast","id":1369542,"title":"Contrasting worldviews and views on sexuality in Princess and Beast?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-22T02:53:08-08:00","id":1369542,"title":"Contrasting worldviews and views on sexuality in Princess and Beast?","content":"I know Princess is only a fan splat, but I really like the concept.<br /> <br /> A couple weeks ago I did a Prelude for my character, a Grace of Diamonds. My ST told me that in her headcanon, one of the reasons the Radiant Princesses were created was to deal with the harm caused by Beasts when they feed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T08:15:51-08:00","id":1369583,"title":"","content":"*eyes title*<br /> <br /> *asks a lot of questions*<br /> <br /> *sips whiskey*<br /> <br /> *lets go*<br /> <br /> Anyways, not inviolable, but from a cosmological point of view the Powers That Be are going to have a decent argument on why A) Beast's harm is any more or less relevant than literally <i>anything else in the world</i>, B) how they reconcile with dealing with the harm of a Beast considering said harm is an extension of an entity that is complexly human-and-not-human, mass-humanity-while-still -an-individual, and a breathing icon in the flesh above all of that <i>without</i> then going on just basically saying humanity needs to be rewritten.<br /> <br /> So <i>maaaaaybe</i>? Certainly it's an <i>easy </i>enough comparison to ignore potential relationships, but part of Princess's point is that there is a Fundamental Good that goes above and beyond the human constructions in the Bright and Primordial Dreams (Temenos) and resides in The Mother's Land(Anima Mundi) <i>at least</i>, and I have trouble seeing how that fundament would end drawing a particular distinction that isn't rendered meaningless in it's articulation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T08:26:35-08:00","id":1369586,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a> I\u2019ve never had whiskey that wasn\u2019t mixed with soda or fruit juice, but other than that, thank you. That was really helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-22T08:33:08-08:00","id":1369588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_containe